{"title":"Lizper Spitter","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 42 Lizper that attacks with stab (ranged).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 3 times (2.3% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/goblin-haft-binding\">Goblin Haft Binding</a> <span class=\"muted\">(crafting catalyst)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Enchanter’s Table</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/lizper-spitter\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/lizper-spitter?lv=42\">Lv 42</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/lizper-spitter?lv=44\">Lv 44 <span>136</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/lizper-spitter?lv=45\">Lv 45 <span>269</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/lizper-spitter?lv=46\">Lv 46 <span>106</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/lizper-spitter?lv=42\" title=\"Pick level 42\"><td><b>42</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>212</td><td>27.6</td><td>2,100</td><td class=\"muted\">636 · 38.6 · 6,300</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/lizper-spitter?lv=44\" title=\"Pick level 44\"><td><b>44</b></td><td>233</td><td>28.7</td><td>2,200</td><td class=\"muted\">699 · 40.2 · 6,600</td><td>136</td><td>in the wilds around 2414, 744</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/lizper-spitter\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>45</b></td><td>243</td><td>29.3</td><td>2,250</td><td class=\"muted\">729 · 41 · 6,750</td><td>269</td><td>in the wilds around 2410, 740</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/lizper-spitter?lv=46\" title=\"Pick level 46\"><td><b>46</b></td><td>254</td><td>29.8</td><td>2,300</td><td class=\"muted\">762 · 41.7 · 6,900</td><td>106</td><td>in the wilds around 2673, 919</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"lizper-spitter\" data-map-level=\"45\">Show level 45 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 36 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 53 recorded drops, 2,267 total, 14–126 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×14–126</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"venom-gland\" title=\"Venom Gland - in 27 of 36 looted corpses, 26 recorded drops, 39 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/de59cbec471a8d0c3fd8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Venom Gland</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.3<b